  "description": "A cross-platform .NET TaskScheduler that pins worker threads to NUMA nodes,\n      keeping task execution and memory access local to the same CPU socket.\n      Supports Windows (SetThreadGroupAffinity / kernel32), Linux (sched_setaffinity / sysfs),\n      and falls back gracefully on macOS and other platforms.\n      Three built-in scheduling policies: RoundRobin, LocalityFirst, and LeastLoaded.",
  "id": "NumaScheduler",
